  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2% of x = 360\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n2% of x = 360\n\n(2 / 100) × x = 360\n\nx = (360 × 100) / 2\n\nx = 36000 / 2\n\nx = 18000\n\n**Therefore, x is equal to 18000.**",
